{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Yona of the Dawn OVA","The first episode adapts two bonus chapters from Mizuho Kusanagi's 12th manga volume, titled \"On That Back\" and \"Kija.\" \"On That Back\" follows an incident at a hot spring hotel, and \"Kija\" depicts the past of the Hakuryuu Kija. The second two episodes adapt the rest of the Zeno Arc and were bundled with the 21st and 22nd volumes of the manga.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["暁のヨナ OVA",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-30370","ids":{"shikimori":30370,"mal":30370,"anilist":21138,"kodik":"serial-22324"},"kodikIds":["movie-47463","serial-22324"],"kodikRevisions":{"movie-47463":"2020-01-10T16:30:06Z","serial-22324":"2020-02-03T22:44:29Z"},"title":"Йона на заре OVA","originalTitle":"Akatsuki no Yona OVA","alt":"Рассвет Йоны OVA / Ёна на Заре Yona of the Dawn OVA 暁のヨナ OVA","description":"Первый эпизод — адаптация двух бонусных глав, включённых в 12 том манги « Йона на заре ». 1. «На пути домой» — описывает инцидент, произошедший с главными героями на горячем источнике. 2. « ] ]» — рассказывает историю прошлого Белого Дракона Ки Джа. Второй и третий эпизоды адаптируют не вошедшее в сериал окончание арки Зено и идут в качестве бонусов к 21 и 22 томам манги.","year":2015,"type":"OVA","genres":["седзе","Приключения","Фэнтези"],"rating":8.11,"popularity":41241,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/30370/ebde8c1fffdc8ab81f5adda717577ef0.jpeg","width":322,"height":450},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21720-hHf6xt2u4pXW.jpg","width":1900,"height":570}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":0,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-767","dubId":"767","label":"SHIZA Project","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId